<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Password Reset Request</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px; }
    .button { 
      background: #3498db; 
      color: white !important; 
      padding: 10px 15px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      border-radius: 4px; 
      display: inline-block; 
      margin: 15px 0; 
    }
    .code { 
      font-size: 24px; 
      letter-spacing: 2px; 
      background: #f4f4f4; 
      padding: 10px 15px; 
      display: inline-block; 
      margin: 15px 0; 
    }
    .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; }
    .option-container { margin: 20px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Password Reset Request</h1>
  </div>
  
  <p>Hello,</p>
  
  <p>We received a request to reset your password for {{appName}}. You can reset your password using either option below:</p>
  
  <div class="option-container">
    <h3>Option 1: Reset Link</h3>
    <p>Click this button to reset your password:</p>
    <p>
      <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button">Reset Password</a>
    </p>
    <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>{{resetUrl}}</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="option-container">
    <h3>Option 2: Verification Code</h3>
    <p>Use this verification code in the password reset form:</p>
    <div class="code">{{verificationCode}}</div>
  </div>
  
  <p>Both options will expire in 1 hour. If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>&copy; {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>